AGENTS.md:22:- Graceful SIGTERM/SIGINT: stop accepting, drain in-flight, close Mongo/Redis, exit.
PRD.md:8:A multi-tenant shared support inbox. Customer messages arrive from Pigeon by webhook; human agents log in, see conversations live, claim, reply, close. **Never lose, never duplicate, never leak across workspaces, never let two agents hold one conversation**, under a bad network, `kill -9`, and several copies.
PRD.md:65:9. **Fail closed on security, fail open on unknown provider events.**
PRD.md:90:| `conversations` | workspace, contact, assignee, state open/closed, lastActivityAt | unique `{workspace, contact}`; `{workspace, lastActivityAt:-1}` |
PRD.md:102:4. `message.inbound`: insert message (`occurred_at` from event). E11000 -> already stored, `200`. Upsert conversation `{$max: {lastActivityAt}}`, `$setOnInsert: {assignee: null, state: 'open'}`; if it was closed, reopen on new inbound (decision). Emit `message.inbound` only when newly inserted. `200`.
PRD.md:126:Release/close/reopen are similar conditional updates.
PRD.md:138:- `/auth/callback`: `GETDEL oidc:<state>` (missing -> 400); POST token (form: grant_type, code, redirect_uri, client_id, client_secret, code_verifier); verify id_token RS256 with JWKS (`crypto.createPublicKey({key: jwk, format: 'jwk'})`), check iss, aud, exp, nonce. Session `sess:<32 random bytes hex>` = `{sub, name, workspaces}` EX 8 h. Cookie `sid` HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, Path=/ (Secure when https). 302 to `WEB_ORIGIN`.
PRD.md:147:  - Roles are only data; we enforce them. Decision: `agent` and `admin` can both read, reply, claim, close and reopen; only `admin` can take over (reassign) a conversation another agent holds. Record in DECISIONS.md.
PRD.md:198:- E1 UI API: `GET /api/conversations/:contact/messages`, `POST .../reply`, `.../claim`, `.../release`, `.../close`, `.../reopen`.
PRD.md:199:- E2 React: login, workspace picker, inbox (paginated), thread view, reply with live status, claim/close/reopen, WS hook reconnecting with `after=lastSeq`.
